# Production native waiting-question form; isolated fake host, no runner or real sends.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion claude
clearlog
expect Questions waiting
tap answer questions
expect Before I continue
tap Beside chat
scrollto Which screen sizes should we check?
tap Cover
tap Unfolded
expect Send:
expect Checks: Cover, Unfolded
nolog waiting question answer
tap back to chat
tap answer questions
expect Layout: Beside chat
expect Checks: Cover, Unfolded
shot waiting-question-cover-ready
rotate landscape
expect Layout: Beside chat
expect Checks: Cover, Unfolded
nolog waiting question answer
shot waiting-question-rotated-draft
rotate portrait
expect Layout: Beside chat
expect Checks: Cover, Unfolded
nolog waiting question answer
shot waiting-question-restored-draft
tap Send:
expect Answers sent
log waiting question answer fixture-ticket
shot waiting-question-cover-sent
fold unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion codex
clearlog
tap answer questions
expect Before I continue
tap Full screen
swipe 0.75 0.8 0.75 0.35 500
tap Cover
expect Layout: Full screen
expect Checks: Cover
nolog waiting question answer
shot waiting-question-unfolded-ready
tap Send:
expect Answers sent
log waiting question answer fixture-ticket
shot waiting-question-unfolded-sent
# [phone] Fake Mac runner AskUserQuestion and Codex question: Send resumes the waiting call with exact answers; never Allow/Deny or queued chat.
# [phone] Phone builder question: wrong/expired nonce and locked-device send refuse; valid Send resumes only the owning builder once.
